00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.640
There's also the general question of what&nbsp;
I've been up to, how I've been doing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:25.760
I guess for the last two years or so I've lived&nbsp;
a pretty reclusive life but to be honest that has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:31.520
very little to do with COVID and lockdowns, that's&nbsp;
just the way that I live my life anyway and how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:37.680
I like to be. So without having to travel or any&nbsp;
need to remove myself from this comfort zone I've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:44.080
just been enjoying living a very quiet existence.&nbsp;
A huge amount of my time though has been spent on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:50.800
my special project called Finding X which is this&nbsp;
animated short film that I've been working on for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:56.240
probably over a year and a half now. It's been&nbsp;
